  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nStep right up to the Twisted Tower! Careful though! Our silly mascots may be looking for a hug, and our carnival rides might need some screws tightened…<p></p>\n<p>So what do you say, chap? Are you tough enough to make it to the top of the tower and save the love of your life?</p>\n<p>Here’s what your ticket will get you upon entering the magical resort:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Explore an abandoned 1950’s resort reminiscent of BioShock and Disney World\n</li><li>Get lost in 5 hauntingly beautiful levels: the hotel, the waterpark, the clown casino, the carnival forest, and the space station\n</li><li>Punchy, bloody gunplay with corrupted fairy-tale mascots\n</li><li>Immerse yourself in a mysterious and emotional story\n</li><li>Choose from a variety of unique paths per playthrough, ensuring the world feels like a fresh new experience\n</li><li>Upgrade your toyish arsenal, including: a whack-a mole mallet, rubber-band pistol, dart throwin’ Tommy Gun, fartin’ shotgun, bubblegum spittin’ chain-gun, sniper slingshot, skull-poppin’ ray gun, and more\n</li><li>Collect bizarre toys to assist you in jumping, dashing, and grappling your way up the tower\n</li></ul>\n",
